      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "seed": 967502558,
      "versionNonce": 1500220624,
      "text": "1.  58 secret values\n     Modives 8 \u00b7 Square 7 \u00b7 Xero/Zoho 6\n     Twilio 6 \u00b7 Bonzah 4 \u00b7 Tesla 3 \u2026\n     \u2192 send any .env, live keys filtered\n\n2.  Crons ON or leave OFF?\n\n3.  apps/api \u2014 alive or dead?\n\n4.  Commit recovered prod-only source?",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.  58 secret values\n     Modives 8 \u00b7 Square 7 \u00b7 Xero/Zoho 6\n     Twilio 6 \u00b7 Bonzah 4 \u00b7 Tesla 3 \u2026\n     \u2192 send any .env, live keys filtered\n\n2.  Crons ON or leave OFF?\n\n3.  apps/api \u2014 alive or dead?\n\n4.  Commit recovered prod-only source?",
